<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nu-Kote Holdings cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nu-Kote Holdings cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter downgraded Nu-Kote Holdings Inc to swap from buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- After the market closed on Friday, Nu-Kote said it expects to report an operating loss for the third quarter ended December 31.</p>
<p>-- Nu-Kote lost 2-1/2 to 6-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>	 (( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
